# Builds whose context is the repo root (sandbox/, sandbox/workspace/) copy only a few
# paths; keep everything else (dependencies, history, data) out of the context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.svelte-kit
**/target
**/build
**/dist
backend/data
data
apps
frontend
docs
